From e823299df986a6add233755320c0f667de6099f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WorkBuddy <workbuddy@example.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:45:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(usb-mcp): add USB Serial/JTAG JSON-RPC channel, no
 Wi-Fi needed

- McpServer: separate kUsbRpcIdBase=2000000 + SetUsbResultSink so the serial
  bridge does not depend on the HTTP server (which only starts after Wi-Fi).
- new usb_mcp_bridge.{h,cc}: non-blocking stdin task reads one JSON line per
  request, forwards to McpServer::ParseMessage(), prints __MCP_RESULT__ line.
  Supports both shorthand {tool,arguments} and standard JSON-RPC.
- main.cc: UsbMcpStart() before Application::Run(); CMakeLists adds source.
- companion Mac client: analysis/integration/usb_mcp_client.py (pyserial).
